<LegalPage title="Refunds & purchase recovery" description="How to recover a Flicksy purchase or request a refund." updated="September 3, 2026">
  <h2>Purchases and redownloads</h2>
  <p>Redownload Flicksy from the Purchased list for the Apple Account that bought the app. There is no in-app purchase to restore. Apple processes App Store refund requests through <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/">Report a Problem</a>.</p>

  <h2>Trial download</h2>
  <p>The direct download is a free 14-day trial and has no purchase to recover or refund.</p>
</LegalPage>
